==Russian==
{{wp|ru:}}
[[File:К.Кукевич.Корчма в предместье.JPG|thumb|right|корчма́|300px]]

===Etymology===
From {{der|ru|sla-pro|*kъrčьma}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|корчма́}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|корчма́|*|gen_pl=корче́м|dim=корчо́мка}}

# {{lb|ru|dated}} [[tavern]], [[inn]] where [[spirits]] are [[sold]] (in [[Ukraine]] or [[Belarus]] before the {{w|Russian Revolution}})
#: {{syn|ru|каба́к|пивна́я|шино́к|бар|паб|тракти́р|харче́вня}}

====Usage notes====
* Historically, there was a legal distinction between a private {{m|ru|корчма́}} or {{m|ru|шино́к}} serving tax-free spirits, and a taxed, government-licensed {{m|ru|каба́к}}.

